\newlabel{fig:feature-drift}{{2.1}{5}{Comparison of no drift versus drift scenarios. Left: When distributions overlap, the adversarial classifier cannot distinguish data sources (AUC $\approx $ 0.5). Right: When drift occurs, distributions shift and the classifier can distinguish sources (AUC $>>$ 0.5)}{figure.caption.1}{}}
